 il pianeta, Baki si pone un solo obiettivo nella vita: diventare il combattente più forte del mondo e sconfiggerlo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Baki the Grappler","overview":"Baki Hanma is a young fighter who yearns to follow in the footsteps of his father, Yujiro, and become the strongest fighter in the world. Through that he trains tirelessly and fights constantly to hone his skills and develop his body to achieve these goals. Many intense battles lay ahead of Baki as he goes about his quest to be the best and ultimately take the title of \"King\" from his father."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"範馬刃牙は13歳、中学生にして向かうところ敵なしの喧嘩巧者だ。しかし、100人相手の喧嘩に挑み、リーダー格の２人は倒したものの、37人で力つきてしまう。こんなことでは駄目だとイラつく刃牙。地上最強と呼ばれる父親の勇次郎に近づき、いつか彼を超えることが彼の夢なのだ。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjZMAEYkw628UMs30SugRA8GU3z.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qjZMAEYkw628UMs30SugRA8GU3z.png","language":"en","width":262,"height":140}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bbAg0FnZKJHnBBe560ZF9YUAekE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bbAg0FnZKJHnBBe560ZF9YUAekE.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9LqCt1xQb6yMyfxzBNKZGPZ4q9e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9LqCt1xQb6yMyfxzBNKZGPZ4q9e.jpg","language":"en","width":1500,"height":2250},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9XVtpJ7wa7RKhrvAGMXYPBfwNz7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9XVtpJ7wa7RKhrvAGMXYPBfwNz7.jpg","language":"en","width":689,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nremnPEdBivDKno1ufEnif8WQJI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nremnPEdBivDKno1ufEnif8WQJI.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vUFWy2qibxFD7bKSI7RVJ73yn99.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vUFWy2qib